        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "X也X不得，Y也Y不得 presents both options as infeasible. The parallel structure expresses a dilemma rather than a free choice.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "走也走不得，留也留不得。",
                "pinyin": "zǒu yě zǒu bude ， liú yě liú bude 。",
                "meaning": "I can neither leave nor stay.",
                "audio": "e7e8a89c9d4e385b7dcc96144aba095ef9365820e7b38210e299d6ee5bcf3026"
              },
              {
                "text": "说也说不得，问也问不得。",
                "pinyin": "shuō yě shuō bude ， wèn yě wèn bude 。",
                "meaning": "I can neither say anything nor ask.",
                "audio": "f923d9c29d6e76315409cde67ecb40f80001043cf80b7b335e2b1db82f4433db"
